    <id>digitalsignage</id>
    <name>Digital Signage</name>
    <summary>Display calendars, weather and image slideshows on public screens</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Digital Signage turns Nextcloud into a simple information screen solution for offices, schools and shared spaces.

Show calendar events, weather information and images on public displays without requiring a login. Use presets for slideshow behavior, assign them per display and switch them remotely through the control API.

Features:
- Calendar events from your Nextcloud calendar
- Image slideshow from a Nextcloud folder
- Weather information (external API)
- Per-display presets and remote preset switching
- Configurable layout, colors and text sizes
- Public share for display without login

Supported languages:
- English (en)
- Deutsch (de, de_DE)
- Français (fr)
- Nederlands (nl)
- Español (es)
- Italiano (it)
]]></description>
